window.products.push({"id":840014,"name":"Salt Grinders and Pepper Mill Shaker, Salt and Pepper Grinder Wood Spice Grinder with Hand Rotate Movement Grinders Adjustable Coarseness Fine to Coar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JWuriyWAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Unique and Sustainable Each individual grinder is made from quality, sustainable grown plantation Natural Wood.Each set of grinders is consistent in size, dimensions and weight, however your set will boast its own unique wood grain, texture and quality finish. Sophisticated Look and Feel These quality salt and pepper grinders will proudly sit on display in your kitchen, on your counter top or the dining table. The smooth feel and natural wood grain appearance will enhance any dining setting. Fine or coarse grind-is it just a question of taste? Actually it depends on personal taste and the dish being prepared. While personal taste plays a role, some dishes call for coarse salt or pepper, whereas others require either or both to be finely ground. A finer grind will be used for a delicate sauce or mixed raw vegetables and a coarse grind for grilling a steak or when making heartier meats and dishes. How to use To refill your salt and pepper grinders simply unscrew the silver top and remove the wooden lid. Top up your grinders with your choice of salt crystals and peppercorns and replace the wooden top and screw. Easy to Clean If you wish to clean the inside of the grinders we recommend using a small brush or an old tooth brush to brush down the internal walls. Package Included 1 x Salt and Pepper Grinder Please Note Separate all the part for cleaning is NOT recommended because some small component might be lost while washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JWuriyWAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vedole","source_asin":"B0811VGLK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0811VGLK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0811VGLK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
