window.products.push({"id":840045,"name":"LANGRIA Shoe Rack Organizer (9 Cubes-Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710u6LfNKlL._SL1024_.jpg","description":"Be creative with the customizable layout of the cube organizer This LANGRIA DIY children modular 9-cube shelving closet with one removable hanging rod is perfect for a modern home with children around. The panel doors have cute animal cartoons, perfect for your child’s bedroom, or playroom. You can build the cubes together to form a larger closet organizer or separate them into a couple of matching cube shelves. Customize the shape of the organizer and put it together and take it apart to reconfigure as many times as you want! Cutest cube organizer to tidy up your child’s bedroom LANGRIA has created this toddler’s fun and colorful 9-cube organizer to perfectly match his/her bedroom or playroom. This closet keeps in place toys, school materials such as the backpack, pencils and other small items, clothes, shoes, the bedding and lining, etc. Teach your child how to tidy up his room after play-time with this adorable cube’s shelving organizer with printed animals on the doors. Maintenance and assembly In order to put together his unit, you will not need any tools. Connect the panels and door panels with the plastic connectors (included). To keep the unit in good shape, clean it with a damp cloth. Please note that each panel might slightly bend when loaded but it’s a normal phenomenon (do not put more than 10 lbs./cube). A mallet (not included) may be needed to lock connectors and panels in place. Kindly keep an eye on children when near the unit. Product specifications Total Closet Dimensions (3 cube W x 3 cube H): W x D x H: 44 x 14.5 x 44 inches (111 x 37 x 111 cm)Dimensions of Each Square Panel: W x H: 13.8 x 13.8 inches (35 x 35 cm)Weight Capacity per Cube: 10 lbs. (4.5 kg)Net Weight: 16.5 lbs. (7.5 kg) Package Includes 9x door panel33x pink panel36x plastic connector1x simple hanging rod1x assembly instruction sheet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710u6LfNKlL._SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANGRIA","source_asin":"B074XSCFNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074XSCFNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074XSCFNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
