window.products.push({"id":840047,"name":"Magnetic Fireplace Draft Stopper for Overnight Heat Loss Fireplace Cover Chimney Insulation Blocker Blanket Black (Small 33\" W x 29\" H)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q23zou4cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【SAVES ENERGY & SAVE MONEY】: This fireplace draft stopper will help keep out the drafts, odors and debris from coming into your home through the fireplace or wood stove. The draft is gone and the thermostat does not come on often anymore. A real money saver in the long run on heating bills. ★【KEEP THE COLD OUT IN WINTER】: Do you have the same problem? Cold drafts push down chimney into room and onto floor in winter, hanging up our fireplace cover can completely eliminate air movement up or down the chimney and into the room. ★【STOP LOSS OF AC IN SUMMER】: Cool air pulled from floor up chimney in summer., so we always need to lower the temperature to keep cool, If you hanging this fireplace insulation blanket, cuts off the exchange of hot and cold air in the chimney, AC will run less in the summer time. ★【TWO STYLES TO CHOOSE】: 2 styles and 3 sizes fireplace draft stopper for you to choose, each style is equipped with 8 magnets or Velcros, please choose according to your fireplace style. If the fireplace is metal frame, you can choose magnet style, if the fireplace is brick, you can choose Velcros for installation. ★【EASY TO INSTALL】: We have fixed the position of the magnet or Velcro to ensure the minimum area of the sticking surface, and the maximum possibility not to damage the fireplace frame. ★ 【EASY TO ROLL UP & STORE】 : Fireplace blocker blanket easy to fold up, store away when not in use this without taking up a ton of space. Black color blends in with the fireplace so you don't even notice it. ★【30 DAYS WARRANTY】: When you receive this fireplace draft stopper blanket if you have any problem, please feel free to contact us. Your satisfaction is our greatest pleasure. ★【NOTE 1】: The fireplace draft blocker built in 8 magnets (the same size as the magnets in the accessory), which are located at 4 corners, top and two sides. Accessories (6 magnets or Velcro) can be used for supplementary installation. ★【NOTE 2】：The fire place draft blocker is not fire retardant, please keep away from high heat or remove the fireplace blanket before you light the fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q23zou4cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CADARA","source_asin":"B0C6N1YJ6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6N1YJ6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6N1YJ6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
