window.products.push({"id":840082,"name":"Metwoo 13 Model Latch Hook Kits for DIY Throw Pillow Cover Car Cushion Cover with Cat/Owl/Dog Pattern 16x16 (Cat)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CzkPjA6CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2. Q: How to make pillowcases and cushions? A: The details page has the pictures of detailed steps. The content of the picture is only the basic technique, and the buyer can design the knotted way according to his own habit. After determining the color, tighten the line segment to prevent the segment from falling. 3. Q: Why my line segment is not enough? A: When crocheting, yarn is unified embroidered in horizontal line. vertical line is not embroidered. If you are all embroidered, you can only demolish vertical line to fill the horizontal line, which does not affect the use. Don’t embroidery both sides. 4. Q: The pillowcase becoming uneven after finished , what to do? A: After all the embroidery, the scissors can be used to repair the redundant lines according to the personal habits. 5. Q: What should we do if the Pillowcase become dirty? Can we wash it with a washing machine? A:  Wash it by hand, Not wash by machine. If it is purely dusty, you can use a large transparent plastic bag and put the pillow into it, and then add a few tablespoons of salt inside to strong shaking. Using the electrostatic principle, salt will absorb most of dust and make pillow cover look new. But don't use the eaten salt. 6. Q: Why there are some errors in the color of the white grid Pillowcase comparing to drawings? A: The white grid pillowcase have error of about 2 lattices with the drawing. Processing can not be completely accurate, which does not affect the actual effect of finished products. Transitional areas can be based on the proportion of color and picture overall effect to choose the color. At present, there is no better solution to solve this problem at home, but it does not affect the overall effect and it's not quality problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CzkPjA6CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Metwoo","source_asin":"B07LBSMZSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LBSMZSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LBSMZSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
