window.products.push({"id":840144,"name":"Tiger Chef 24-Pack Plastic Measured Liquor Pourer without Collar, 1 1/4 Ounce Clear, Precision Wine Bottle Pour Spout with Pourer Dust Covers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ufybaSgUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Pour a perfectly measured amount of liquor every time with these colored measured liquor bottle pourers. These bottle pourers are made from hard plastic with graduated fins on the neck to help prevent leakage. They fit into most standard-sized liquor bottles and are basically fool-proof. Just insert the measured pourer, flip your bottle upside down, and watch in wonder as gravity precisely measures out ounces of potent goodness for your cocktail. Stop wasting money with free-flow pourers that eat away at your margins and inventory by giving away extra ounces with each pour. Trust Tiger Chef’s measured liquor bottle pourers without collars to get the job done and help your bottom line.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ufybaSgUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiger Chef","source_asin":"B0746NH62V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746NH62V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746NH62V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840145,"name":"Oihxsetx Instant Read Meat Thermometer, IP66 Waterproof Kitchen Thermometer Food thermometer with 8 Preset Temperature modes , Backlight and Calibrata","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710MZ30xPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Suitable for a variety of cooling/heating food processing, a variety of meat, liquid temperature measurement. It’s can be used in outdoor barbecue, baby milk, water, turkey, cold drink, jam, candy, baking, kitchen cooking etc. More Special Functions: 1.Read temperature quickly and accurately in 3-5 seconds. 2.When the preset temperature is reached, a beep sounds to remind the user 30.Voice prompts make it easier for the seniors to achieve accurate readings. 4.0Easily make the doneness of 8 types of meat including beef and lamb. 5.4 degrees of doneness are available: medium-rare, medium, medium-well, and well-done. 6.Temperature °C/°F switching function to meet different people’s habits. 7.Temperature HOLD function, can lock the temperature when the measurement is finished. 8.A  magnetic back means you can easily attach your thermometer to metallic surface of home appliances. 9.IP66 waterproof design keeps your food thermometer safe from splashes and more kitchen disasters. 10.Turn on / off at 45 degrees & rotate at 180 degrees at different angles for easier use. Specifications: 1. Measurement range: -22°F ~ 572°F / -30°C ~ 300°C 2. Resolution: 0.1°F / 0.1°C 3. Temperature units: °F or °C 4. Folding probe: 4.25 in, 0° ~ 180° degrees 5. Accuracy: ±1.8°F (±1°C when measured in Celsius) in the range of 32°F ~ 392°F (0°C ~  200°C); ±3.6°F (2°C when) Measured in Celsius) in the rest of range Important Tips: 1. Please note don’t touch hot probe by hand to avoid be burned when removed from high temperature. 2. Please do not keep the thermometer in oven and roaster when cooking. 3. Do not completely immerse the food thermometer in water for minutes.(IP66 waterproof design)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710MZ30xPRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oihxsetx","source_asin":"B088LR6192","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LR6192","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LR6192","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
