window.products.push({"id":840178,"name":"CHAOMIC to My Daughter Blanket from Mom Dad Blanket Love Letter to My Daughter, 100% Wool Flannel, Hand & Machine Washable, Soft & Lightweight Flannel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xt7NL2MCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To my daughter, whenever you feel overwhelmed, remember whose daughter you are, and straighten your crown. Remember you are braver than you think, stronger than you seem, and more loving than you know. Wrap yourself up and treat it like a big hug!! Love, your Mom & Dad [Dating Gift] This soft flannel blanket is a thoughtful gift for mom or dad to daughter, it can provide warmth in different seasons, also suitable for camping and picnics. Not only does this blanket keep you warm, it also hopefully infuses you with confidence, courage and love. [SOFT MATERIAL] This blanket for dad, mom, daughter is made of soft wool material with words of love and care for your daughter, and it keeps its beautiful color vibrancy even after washing. [Multipurpose] You can cover it while reading in bed, or drape it over your body while operating your phone and computer while leaning on the sofa, or snuggle with your lover while chatting by the fireplace. [Easy to Clean] Machine wash in cold water, then tumble dry on low heat or air dry. To prevent the blanket from fraying, try to avoid washing it with other clothes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xt7NL2MCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHAOMIC","source_asin":"B0BV621K4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV621K4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV621K4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
