window.products.push({"id":840195,"name":"IVSUN Mini Bag Sealer,2 in 1 Heat Sealer with Cutter,Bag Heat Sealer Handheld Portable Vacuum Sealers for Chip Bags Plastic Bags Food Storage Snack Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qx0ptruoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Security: This mini portable bag sealer is made of high-quality ABS material and adopts safe structure design. The heating sheet is hidden under the opening and protected by a slidable cover, uneasy to touch and anti-scald.The cutter is under the cover and you need to slide the button to open it. 2 in 1 Powerful Function: Our mini sealer machine with cutter can help you store the remaining snacks,fruit,dried fruits,food,etc easier. Avoid moisture, refuse the taste of multiple foods from mixing, and keep food fresh. The blade part of the heat sealer can help you open the express,packaging,etc faster. Very suitable and portable for use in kitchen,camping,travel,office,school. Easy to Use: You don't need to preheat before using the bag sealer, just press and pull the mini food sealer across the bag to form an airtight seal. IVSUN portable heat sealer Suitable for daily fries snack packaging bags,ordinary plastic bags,film-coated aluminum foil bags, PP, PE, PVC bags, thin sealed bags, etc. Strong Sealing Effect: The handheld bag sealer machine adopts the principle of hot melt sealing, any type of plastic bag or aluminum bag will be affected by the sealing force. IVSUN plastic sealer has stronger sealing effect and no air leakage. Perfect Gift: Unlike the bulky bag vacuum sealer machines, this portable plastic bag sealer is compact in size, about 3.14inch(80 mm) in length, weight is about 1.4oz(40g), and is with unique and bright color. Very suitable for Christmas,Thanksgiving, Black Friday, and is the best birthday, holiday,holiday gifts for mothers,friends and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qx0ptruoL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IVSUN","source_asin":"B087WR51QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087WR51QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087WR51QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840196,"name":"Bed Bug Blocker FRE146 Mattress Cover, Twin XL, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aE1IADLNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All-In-One Zip-Up Mattress Protector, those worries are a thing of the past. The exclusive design not only helps any unwanted visitors, but invisible problems as well. The closure is so secure due to its triple seal. Our Mattress Protector features three microporous layers that are completely stain and water resistant; so if the kids have an accident or you happen to spill your drink, your mattress is left untouched and protected. The non-bulky design means you won’t even know it’s there – or hear that it’s there – in the case of so many other mattress covers. You can confidently add your sheets, pillows, comforter, and blankets without worry about any uninvited guests taking over your bed with All-In-One Zip-Up Mattress Protector.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aE1IADLNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bed Bug Blocker","source_asin":"B0BWVW4W4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWVW4W4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWVW4W4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
