window.products.push({"id":840211,"name":"Serene Spaces Living Mini Green Glass Le Midi Bell Bud Vase, Centerpiece for Wedding Reception, Mini Flower Vases for Home Decor, Vintage Bottle Style","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MqYpF5P4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VINTAGE STYLE BOTTLES: Place these vintage bottles on a shelf or table to add class to your space. The bell bud vase has the words Le Midi 15 R8 on it LOVELY COLOR: Our jars come in a subtle green color that bring country farmhouse charm to your home. DECOR: Use this set as vases for artificial flowers or as centerpieces for wedding decorations. MEMORABLE GIFT: Purchase these bottles as a gift for a stylish friend or design-savvy family member. FEATURES: Our green 2.75\" x 2.75\" bud bottles have a short neck and sturdy base to easily hold decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MqYpF5P4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serene Spaces Living","source_asin":"B08B6C42K5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B6C42K5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B6C42K5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840212,"name":"Nordic Ware Tunnel of Bundt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cbUAOvv0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Create beautiful bundt cakes with filling in the center! Simply place the tunnel on the cone of any Bundt pan while baking and remove when cake is done. You'll be left with a tunnel for your favorite filling. Use a standard mix and frosting or one of the recipes included. The non-stick baking ring creates ready-to-fill tunnels and fits all 10-15 cup casts or formed Bundt pans. Proudly made in the USA by Nordic Ware. Amazon.com Long famous for inventing the bundt pan, NordicWare takes the popular baking tool one step further with this clever Tunnel of Bundt insert. The nonstick aluminized-steel ring fits over the center cone of any of NordicWare's 10-to-15-cup bundt forms to create an open tube in the batter during baking. When the cake is done, remove the Tunnel by lifting the stay-cool riveted handle, then load up the empty space with a favorite filling. Invert the cake onto a platter and serve--just like that, a simple recipe gets a delicious and decorative upgrade. The Tunnel measures 7-1/2 by 1-3/4 inches and goes safely into the dishwasher for easy cleanup. It is made in the USA. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41cbUAOvv0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nordic Ware","source_asin":"B000FM2VU0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FM2VU0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FM2VU0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840213,"name":"Moroccan Poufs Leather Luxury Ottomans Footstools Red Unstuffed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EVeCFEO2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Moroccan leather poufs are a must have for any room of your home and our now available on pre order in my store I have one in every room of my house including the bathroom because you know someone always wants to chat about something when you are trying to relax! These authentic leather ottomans have so many uses around your home, they can be a footstool or used as extra seating, from the living room to the bedroom to the kids playroom. All of these leather poufs are individually made by artisans in Morocco and ethically purchased using fair trade. After sourcing and buying the goat skin, it is cut and hand painted or dyed, then sent to the outskirt of Marrakech to be stitched and finished with silk embroidery by local Moroccan women to show off expert craftsmanship and a result that is durable and will stand the test of time. There are five people involved in making each pouf and it takes up one day to complete it. They are all wonderfully unique, with subtle variations in the colour of the leather and will look beautiful and last for many years to come. Below are all the colours I have in store but if there is a colour you love and you don't see it here, please send me a message and I'll see what I can do size dimension:20 to21 inch high : 12 to 13 inch note: we only sell cover pouf not stuffed pouf coz it cost for extra money shipping We sell retail and wholesale Feel free to contact us","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EVeCFEO2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"moroccan poufs","source_asin":"B019PNWO7O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019PNWO7O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019PNWO7O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840214,"name":"Thomas Kinkade Follow the Yellow Brick Road Gallery Wrap Canvas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HYOryNwnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Featuring Thomas Kinkade’s best-loved images, our Gallery Wraps are perfect for any space. Each wrap is crafted with our premium canvas reproduction techniques and hand wrapped around a deep, hardwood stretcher bar. Hung as an ensemble or by itself, this frame-less presentation gives you a versatile way to display art in your home. Features Premium canvas substrate Hardwood strecher bar Certificate of authenticity included Image Notes Since its opening, The Wizard of Oz film has captured the hearts and imaginations of millions of viewers. In Follow the YELLOW BRICK ROAD, all of the great Wizard of Oz characters are captured as their journey begins down the fabulous Yellow Brick Road. Glinda the Good Witch looks on as the Munchkins merrily celebrate their newly gained freedom from the Wicked Witch of the East whose demise came from a falling house. Above “Munchkinland”, the Professor Marvel balloon floats towards the Emerald City while Dorothy, Scarecrow, Tin Man and Cowardly Lion begin their adventure. And, of course, the Wicked Witch of the West looks on, watching their progress and hoping for an opportunity to capture the fabled Ruby Slippers. The color and beauty of the Land of Oz have been elaborated in this masterwork using Thomas Kinkade Studios’ signature romantic luminist style. Gorgeous flower beds line the Yellow Brick Road and the mountains in the distance are glowing with the warmth of the passing day. The dappling of light on the ground appears from the shadows as the sun bursts through the foliage of the trees. Dimension emerges and the image comes to life with these artistic effects. Join with Thomas Kinkade Studios and all those who love the fantasy of The Wizard of Oz in celebration of this exciting release. Thomas Kinkade Studios, LLC, Morgan Hill, CA. THE WIZARD OF OZ and all related characters and elements are trademarks of and Turner Entertainment Co. Judy Garland as Dorothy from THE WIZARD OF OZ (S13)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HYOryNwnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thomas Kinkade","source_asin":"B00FM2WU9U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FM2WU9U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FM2WU9U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
