window.products.push({"id":840264,"name":"artcandi The Lost Boys Signed + Lost Boys Film Cells Framed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51U+yMpw92L._AC_.jpg","description":"Reproduction autographed display featuring rare, original film cells. Dimensions approx 27cm x 32cm. Film footage is unique to each presentation & will therefore vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51U+yMpw92L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artcandi","source_asin":"B00B2PQE7A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B2PQE7A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B2PQE7A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840265,"name":"Pink Hibiscus Abstract Artwork by Kurt Shaffer, 14 by 32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wk-vnygIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a pink flower. Kurt Shaffer has been a self-taught photographer since age 13 (1970). He continues to learn the fine art of photography, especially in this fantastic digital age. Though Kurt does not manipulate his fine art photography, digital enhancement is a valuable tool in his business. He states that if he were to change anything in his work it would be to make it look more like it was when he took the original photo. Kurt's love of the earth feeds his photographic creativity and defines it as his truest form of therapy. When photographing people, capturing the nature in his subjects is Kurt's intent and what he strives to do. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wk-vnygIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00UD8TBHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UD8TBHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UD8TBHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840266,"name":"Ashleigh's Tulip Cupcake Liners - 100 Pink Floral Cupcake Wrappers, Baking Cups, Muffin Cups, Cupcake Cups for Baking Pans & Muffin Pan Liners (Botani","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eSXvZBS-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ashleigh's Baking Cups Are For Any Event Where Your Cupcakes Or Muffins Should Dress To Impress Tulip Baking Cups Elevate The Look Of Your Baked Goods When Presentation Matters. ✔️ BOXED so you receive perfectly shaped baking cups/liners. ✔️ BEAUTIFUL DESIGNS to elevate the look of your baked goods. ✔️ PERFECTLY SIZED for standard cupcake pans and muffin pan and for serving treats. ✔️ OIL-RESISTANT, OVEN SAFE baking paper cups are disposable and recyclable. Like your favorite potato chips, your tulip baking cups may settle in the package and your stack of beautiful paper cups may appear shorter than you expect. Though they may be nested together more tightly, your package will contain the correct number of tulip cupcake cups. Thank you for baking with Ashleigh's Baking Cups.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eSXvZBS-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ashleigh's","source_asin":"B09MR8FXPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MR8FXPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MR8FXPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
