window.products.push({"id":840268,"name":"CCINEE Halloween Door Curtain Black Shiny Foil Party Decorations Skull Entrance Door Curtain for Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MBHq08NdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Package includes: One PET door decoration, one tinsel curtain, one double-sided glue and one plastic pipe(used for packing the decoration). Size: The PET door decoration: 39 in×11 in. The tinsel curtain: 0.4 in×0.8 in. The double-sided glue: 0.5 in×10 yd. Design: It is full of Halloween elements, like skull, pumpkins, and the black shiny foil is suitable for Halloween atmosphere, they are perfect combination for Halloween. Easy to use: We provide a double-sided glue, just use it in the back of the PET door decoration, then paste the decoration on the door. The black shiny foil, which has adhesive on itself, is easier to use. Applications: This Halloween foil fringe is suiable for Halloween party decorations, you can use it to decorate the party doorway or hang it up for a great party photo booth background.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MBHq08NdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CCINEE","source_asin":"B07VGB46MK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VGB46MK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VGB46MK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840269,"name":"Marinex Bakeware Small Rectangular Glass Roaster, 11-5/8\" x 7\" x 2\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41saocD0KcL._AC_.jpg","description":"Marinex Glass Bakeware production began over 50 years ago by Santa Marina, the largest glass manufacturer in Latin America. Located in Brazil, Santa Marina has been producing different glass products since 1895. The factory location is close to raw material deposits of boron and sand which is rich in color and quality. During the production process, these raw materials are combined using heat to make borosilicate glass. Borosilicate glass is resistant to changes in temperatures used in cooking and baking. The raw materials also give Marinex glass bakeware a slight bluish tint consistant throughout all pieces. Marinex Glass Bakeware offers several shapes and sizes that have countless uses in culinary activities and are prominent by their beauty, durability, and ease of cleaning. It can be used to prepare, bake, and serve food as well as to freeze prepared food. It is safe for both conventional ovens and microwave ovens. Marinex Bakeware can go from the freezer/refrigerator to a pre-heated oven where the oven temperature does not exceed 100C or 212F to start. However, Marinex Bakeware should not be used on stovetop burners or over a direct flame. This is a small 1.7qt rectangular baking dish that measures 11-5/8\" x 7\" x 2\". All Marinex bakeware is dishwasher safe. Item #GD16532011.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41saocD0KcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marinex","source_asin":"B0016LKPZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0016LKPZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0016LKPZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
