window.products.push({"id":840326,"name":"Portable Electric Space Heater 1500W/750W Personal Room Heater with Over-Heat & Tip-Over Protection, PTC Ceramic Heater, Small Space Heaters for Bedro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bj+GGtPrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do You Want To Change From A Cold Environment To A Warm Environment In A Short Time? Why Did You Choose Our Portable Space Heater? ★ Over-Heat & Tip-Over Protection ღSafety protection adopts PTC ceramic heating technology, and the bottom of the product is equipped with a drop switch. ღWhen it comes out of contact or tip over, it will automatically close. ★ Safe & Save ღPTC ceramic heating technology Our electric ceramic heater will not overheat, while saving energy, safety and long service life. ღSave the overall heating cost, use a portable heater to heat your room and lower the thermostat of the entire room. This also reduces the wear of the main heating system. ★ Low Noise ღ50 decibel low noise will not affect your sleep, reading and work. Both men and women can use portable ceramic space heaters. Regardless of age, it is suitable for offices, families, dormitories, bedrooms, etc. ★ Multiple Mode Selection ღYou can choose hot, warm or fan only mode, which is warm in winter and cool in summer. ღThis ceramic space fan heater can output wind quickly. Its fan mode can generate natural air circulation without increasing heat, and is designed with a thermostat to provide personal comfort. ★ Product Specifications: ☀Weight: 3Ib ☀Voltage: 120V ☀Frequency: 50Hz ☀Output Power (W): 1500W ☀Dimensions: 5.9 X 5.9 X 10.2in ★ Precautions: ♨1. Do not touch the grid of the front air outlet with your hands during use to avoid being burned ♨2. Do not use outdoors ♨3. Do not use the heater in the immediate surroundings of a bath, a shower or a swimming pool. ♨4. Make sure put the heater on flat and hard surfaces. ♨5. In case of automatic overheat shut off, unplug the heater & wait about 30 minutes to cool down, then reset the heater. ♨6. In order to avoid overheat, do not cover the heater. ★ What is included? ☪1 x Electric Space Heater ☪1 x Product manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bj+GGtPrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BabyNora","source_asin":"B0BGR8FHCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGR8FHCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGR8FHCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
