window.products.push({"id":840453,"name":"Lareth LED Makeup Vanity Mirror with Lights Large Lighted Mirror for Desk, Tabletop, Makeup Mirror with Dimmable 3-Color Lights, Black, 23\" Wx19 H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AU1iii-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-Color Lighting Modes & Brightness Adjustment】Built in LED strips, the vanity mirror provides bright and clear reflection. You can choose your favorite lighting modes among cool white, neutral white, and warm white by simply touching the changing button. It also supports brightness adjustment, giving you complete control over your makeup lighting 【Smart Touch Screen & Memory Function】 3 Smart touch buttons for this light up vanity mirror: Middle button for power ON/OFF and clock setting; the left button can adjust the light modes; the right button can adjust the brightness. Intelligent light memory function make you easy to use the suitable light adjusted last time,which helps you get the right natural light, to create your most perfect makeup 【Time & Humidity and Temperature Function】This makeup mirror with lights comes with a clock, humidity and temperature function. The clock (12-hour clock) parameter setting sequence is hour->minute (tens)->minute (ones). You can begin to set the clock by long pressing the middle switch button, however, the humidity (H) and the temperature (F) will automatically detect and display, and can’t be adjusted 【Large Size & Perfect Gift】 Measuring 23\"W x 19\"H, the makeup mirror is the perfect size to provide you with a good upper body view. It's large enough to suit some medium/large dressing tables. It's also a perfect gift for all the girls on special days such as birthdays, Valentine's Day, Mother’s Day, and so on 【Two-Way Mounted】Tabletop and wall mounted lighted vanity mirror,this large makeup mirror designed with detachable base and two hole behind for hanging, can be hung on the wall or placed on the table. You can get a Lighted Vanity Mirror and a acrylic lipstick box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AU1iii-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lareth","source_asin":"B09ZP1KVTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZP1KVTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZP1KVTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
