window.products.push({"id":840464,"name":"The Rug Collective Distressed Vintage Cezanne Blush Area Rug Perfect for Living Rooms, Bedrooms, Dining Rooms/Easy to Clean, Durable, Stylish and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10H8nySg0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAY GOODBYE TO MESSY SPILS... REVIVE THE SPACE YOU ARE IN AND LOVE With The Rug Collective's Vintage Crown collection you don't have to worry about spills soaking in and ruining your area rug. Unlike other rugs on the market, our rugs are 100% water-resistant, allowing you to easily wipe them clean. Featuring an \"Everklean\" protection layer that provides maximum protection and easy of mind. When need be our rugs are also Machine Washable the Everklean protection will last up to 7 washes.You don't need to choose between easy to clean and style with us.  The Vintage Crown collection is the perfect blend of easy to clean, durability and style. WATER REPELLENT: Wine, coffee etc. simply rolls off the surface and can be wiped away with a damp cloth with zero stainings. Everklean coats each fiber individually which means the texture of the fabric remains unaffected and allowing the rug to “breathe”. MACHINE WASHABLE : They take a beating though. If you’re looking for an easy-care rug that can stand up to the traffic, and be thrown into the washing machine to bring it back to looking like new again, these rugs tick all the boxes.We stand by our products 100% and if for any reason you are not 100% satisfied with your order when it arrives you can send it back to us for a full refund. We back all our products with a 30 day money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10H8nySg0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE RUG COLLECTIVE","source_asin":"B085HK1V5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085HK1V5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085HK1V5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840465,"name":"AdHoc Rapido Milk and Sauce Frother - Battery Operated Handheld Milk Frother - Mini Electric Whisk and Frother for Milkshakes, Cocktails, Sauces, Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Cr7a-xiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a specialty coffee drink or perfectly whipped cream with the AdHoc Rapido Milk and Sauce Frother. This handheld milk frother is quite versatile. As a cold foam milk frother, it can prepare delicious frothy milk for lattes, macchiatos, cappuccinos, and many more coffee specialties. Additionally, the manual frother can help to prepare milkshakes, cocktails, sauces, vinaigrettes, or soups. Thanks to its powerful engine and robust shaft, this travel frother quickly whisks ingredients quickly at 10,000 revolutions per minute (RPM). The battery-operated feature and included storage case makes this portable milk frother a great addition to any picnic or road trip. When you're done using this travel frother with a case, simply rinse the shaft and whisk with water. For a deeper cleaning, you can remove the whisk and put it in the dishwasher. This portable frother can be elegantly stored in its protective cover or placed in its stand on your countertop for easy access. This milk frother is an excellent kitchen tool or gadget to add to your collection. Product Details: Approximate Dimensions: 8.26\"\" x 2.6\"\" x 3.94\"\" Product Type: Handheld Body Material: Stainless steel Power Source: Three AAA batteries (batteries not included) Please note, this milk frother can’t be filled. Since 1995, the AdHoc team has been developing, designing and producing according to our principle: \"\"design follows function.\"\" This principle follows the idea that more solid functionality leads to more beauty, more quality and more value. The innovative functions of each item are a true rarity. Whether you're an everyday cook or a kitchen professional, all tasks can become a thrilling experience with these elegant and simple kitchen accessories. All AdHoc products come with a two-year manufacturer guarantee. This warranty does not cover damage caused by accident, misuse, abuse, commercial use, or normal wear and tear.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Cr7a-xiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AdHoc","source_asin":"B083WFYDVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083WFYDVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083WFYDVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
