window.products.push({"id":840574,"name":"Panku Fuzzy Faux Fur Throw Blanket for Couch, Extra Soft Warm Fluffy Fleece Blanket Throw for Couch, Sofa, Travel, Lightweight Decorative Throw, 50x60","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yu5ohc3AL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"SOFT & PLUSH: Woven from 100% premium polyester, an ultra soft and plush fiber, Whale Panku fuzzy faux fur throw blanket features an extra-soft feel. It's perfect for snuggling up on the sofa or bed, providing warmth and comfort on cold winter nights. STYLISH & VERSATILE: The color and elegant design of the blanket make it a perfect addition to any room. Use it to decorate your couch, sofa, chair or armchair, and add an extra layer of texture and style to your furniture. It is also suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, great for camping, traveling, car and backpacking. PERFECT SIZE & FIT: The blanket comes in a size of 50x60 inches, making it suitable for various bed sizes, including twin, queen, and king. Please measure the size of your bed and mattress before purchasing to ensure a perfect fit. The double-sided design makes it reversible, giving you two different looks in one blanket. ALL-SEASON USAGE: This blanket is perfect for all seasons. Its lightweight and breathable material make it suitable for use in summer, while its warmth and coziness make it ideal for winter. Use it as a bedspread, throw blanket, or wrap yourself up in it on chilly evenings. EASY MAINTENANCE: Thanks to the durability and long-lasting attribute of the premeium microfiber, this faux fur fleece blanket is machine washable and easy to maintain. Machine wash in cold gentle cycle, tumble dry at low speed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yu5ohc3AL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panku","source_asin":"B0C3LV1S18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3LV1S18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3LV1S18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
