window.products.push({"id":840692,"name":"Mawill Luxury Set of 2 Bath Towels, 27\" x 54\", Cotton Highly Absorbent and Quick Dry Bath Towel, Large Hotel Towel (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vv5UyaP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton SET INCLUDES:(2 pieces) 27 x 54 inch bath towels. SOFTNESS: These washcloths are made from high-quality ultra-fine cotton thread which provides the best softness and smoothness experience. Our towels are designed with solid color arrows. The super soft cotton terry structure and simple design are very suitable for daily families and hotels, allowing you to enjoy the softness of spa treatments. DURABLE：The edge of the towel uses double stitches to prevent it from spreading after washing. The towel adopts a fine weave, which enhances the durability of the towel. Our durable towels last longer than normal towels. EXTRA ABSORBENT AND QUICK-DRY: The face towel adopts dual properties and has extra absorbency, which can quickly absorb moisture on the body surface and provide you with the best comfort. These towels will dry quickly after a special manufacturing process, you can hang them to dry after use. EASY CARE: To achieve the best results, please clean it once according to the washing instructions on the towel label before using it for the first time. Please note that we use environmentally friendly cotton, which does have slight fluff. Please wash the towels separately. In the first few washes, if there is a slight color fade or some small fluff is observed, it is normal. You can dry it comfortably without affecting the softness and water absorption of the towel. CUSTOMER SERVICE: We are a company focused on producing high-quality towels. Our excellent and practical towel set meets the daily use of every family or hotel. We sincerely invite you to choose our towel set. If you have any questions about our towel set, you can contact us at any time. We provide you with free return and exchange services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Vv5UyaP1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mawill","source_asin":"B08P7BBR38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P7BBR38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P7BBR38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
