window.products.push({"id":840759,"name":"Fairy Lights Plug in, 66FT 200 LED Waterproof Fairy String Lights with Remote, 16 Color Changing Twinkle Firefly Lights with 4 Modes & Timer for Bedro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I6Fh0LErL._AC_SL1467_.jpg","description":"【Color Changing Fairy Lights】- Terrific 66ft 200 Led twinkle lights comes with 16 colors and multi-color in 4 lighting modes, so you can choose the suitable color to add a different vibe, like green for St.partrick day, red for Valentine's day, white for a wedding, muti-color for Christmas, etc. The plug-in style helps you get rid of changing batteries and won't casue any harm to environment. 【2 Ways For Light Control】- Plug in fairy string lights with remote adopts the advanced infrared technology, sensing distance can reach 16ft. Point the remote at the receiver to control. You can turn on the lights on/off, switch from 16 colors, set 4 lighting modes, 5 brightness levels and 6 hours on, 18 hours off timer function. You can also push the button on the wire to change color in case the remote lost. 【Safe & Waterproof LED Lights】- The UL-certified adapter has low power, Output 5V1A, which allows the outdoor indoor fairy string lights to remain cool and safe to touch even after a long time of usage. The wire parts of the led string lights is IP65 waterproof, thus making it submersible and work well on rainy days outdoor, but pls note the plug-in adapter is not waterproof. 【Flexible Copper Wire Lights】- Our high-quality twinkle lights for bedroom used 4 tough copper wires twisted into 1 strand, which helps keep stable brightness and prolong its lifetime. 66ft silver copper wire can be easily twisted into any shape you desire and make your living room cozier. When you are done with the lights you can reel the lights in to keep them untangled for your next use. 【 Widely Used Decorative Lights】- The multi-color fairy string lights are treated with fogged technology, soft bright but not dazzling firefly lights, perfect for kids bedroom, wall, home, wedding, garden, party, Christmas, holiday decor etc. Every LED wrapped with epoxy, creating a dreamy lighting effect, like numerous firefly dancing, from indooor to outdoor, it will instantly light up your mood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I6Fh0LErL._AC_SL1467_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSATEN","source_asin":"B08YYL3M58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YYL3M58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YYL3M58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
