window.products.push({"id":840967,"name":"Lord of the Rings Mug, 12 oz Stainless Steel Wine & Coffee Tumbler — Double Wall Insulated Tumbler with Lid — LOTR Merchandise, Accessories for Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YLBmX6NAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOR A TRUE FAN: This stainless steel insulated tumbler is a must-have for a die-hard Lord of the Rings fan who'd love to show off their love for The Lord of the Rings book, movie and series! This 12oz wine, coffee, and beer mug is a perfect gift for an eager fan who'd love a medieval style mug to match their Halloween costume! NOT ALL THOSE WHO WANDER ARE LOST: Our LOTR cup features unique double-walled insulation. The tumbler is designed to keep drinks hot for up to four (4) hours and cold for up to ten (10) hours! In addition, it has a sweat-free exterior that will keep your hands dry and prevent water rings on tables. DURABLE & UNIQUE: To prevent breaking and denting, our tumbler for men and women is made out of 18/8 stainless steel. It also has a non-slip bottom that will prevent the occasional accidental spill. Its rugged, compact design makes it the perfect travel cup. TAKE IT ANYWHERE: The Age of Sage tumbler with lid is versatile, sleek and stylish. The insulated travel mug works great in an office, by the pool or when you're in the car running errands. Take this modern cup with you wherever you go and get noticed! AGE OF SAGE: Our company prides itself on making stemless wine glasses and steel tumbler cups that are perfect for any occasion. The funny graphics are sure to get a laugh at the party, office, or any celebration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YLBmX6NAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Age of Sage","source_asin":"B0BCQZF8HX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCQZF8HX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCQZF8HX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
