window.products.push({"id":840973,"name":"DiNeop Glow in The Dark Wall Clock - 12\" Silent Non-Ticking Quartz Luminous Wall Clocks - Night Light Numbers and Hands - Good for Home Kitchen Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iEamwkx9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Remark: The product might be run out of energy during a long day in the box, so we advise to let the wall clock absorb light energy (sunshine or fluorescent lamp) more than 4 hour before installation when receive the products.Specification:1. 100 Percent Brand New. 2. Color: White Frame /Black Face3. Material Type :Plastic. 4. Pointer Material : Metal. 5. Pointer Color : Green. 6. Movement :Quartz ( Battery Powered). 7. Diameter : 12 inch. 8. Style : Modern / Simple9. Display : Analog. 10. Shape : Round. 11. Item Type : Wall clock. 12. Packing Includes: 1x Wall Clock ,1x HookGrow In The Dark Wall Clock Nightlight function and Simple round shape clock, which the time displayis available and clear to read in dark night.How to Install 1.First Step: please fix the hook on the wall before hanging the clock. 2.Second Step: please insert one AA Battery and set time.3.Third Step: the back slot hangs on the hook. Silent Non Ticking ClockAccurate quartz movement with silent and no ticking sweep movement, which ensures a good sleep and best working environment.Night light handsAdopted quartz movement, quiet and accurate, metal hands with night light function, which provides peaceful and comfortable moment.wall clock","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iEamwkx9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DiNeop","source_asin":"B097DKMZF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097DKMZF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097DKMZF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840974,"name":"GNEGNI Hat Rack, Hanging Closet Hat Organizer, Baseball Caps and Hats Storage Holder, 6 Shelf Pockets Foldable Cap Rack Hat Holder Hanging on Door, Wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uDJ8BVmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Display Neatly & Protect Caps】Are you tired of throwing your hats everywhere? Our hat organizer is the good solution to keep the room clean and tidy without wasting space. Storage and display your hat in beautiful hat rack while protecting your hats from creases, dents and wrinkles. For using our cap hanging rack, you can quickly grab the hat you need and help you simplified the process of choosing a hat. 【Humanized Storage Space】Hat Holder has 6 separate shelves to place all kinds of hats and other small items such as baseball, golf, and sports caps, sunglasses, socks etc. Each storage pocket has large slots that won't touch your hats, thus keeping them in shape. Depending on your needs, you can store multiple hats in one pocket. Meanwhile, you can use side Velcro to shrink unused pockets to save space. 【Durable & Foldable】Our hanging organizer hat rack uses sturdy 300D encrypted felt materials, which is tightly stitched to ensure that it lasts for many years. The supported bottom grants it stability, ensuring high load bearing and that it will not rotate or slide when suspended. You can fold the closet hat organizer into a flat square for storage when it is not in use, so you can carry it easily. 【Simple Hanging Design】It is very easy for you to install our closet hat organizer. Unfold the hat rack and fix it on the cross bar of the wardrobe with top strong Velcro. In addition, we give two metal hooks for you to hang the baseball hat storage on the door. Or you can also hang the hat rack for wall directly by sticky hooks. There are many ways to use the hat holder for you to choose from. 【Wide Applicability】Our cap hanging rack is suitable for all kinds of wardrobe hanging clothes cross bar. When you hang the hat organizer on the door, it is suitable for doors of different thicknesses. You can use the hat holder in your daily home storage, and when you travel, you can also take it to the hotel. Use vertical space to reduce clutter, it will be a great helper to your storage!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uDJ8BVmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GNEGNI","source_asin":"B09T2CQ6FM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2CQ6FM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2CQ6FM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
