window.products.push({"id":840990,"name":"Feng Shui Gold Bar, Golden Bars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yh4pl0cAL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Feng Shui gold bar is the powerful feng shui product to activate the wealthy chi. Gold bar is the symbol of wealth that you can add them to your wealthy vase or money corner to increase money luck. There are 5 golden bars in one box and Chinese auspicious words: Fuk, Luk, Sao, Xi and Cai on each of the bars.  Each of the bars is approx. 2 1/4\" x 3/4\" x 1/2\" and they are made of brass and gold plated. The meanings of the Fuk, Luk, Sao, Xi and Cai are as followings: Fuk - Good Luck; Luk - High Rank; Sao - Longevity; Xi - Happiness; Cai - Wealth See more Feng Shui Ingot","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yh4pl0cAL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Feng Shui Import","source_asin":"B00KKWLUES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KKWLUES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KKWLUES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840991,"name":"Modway Wing Loveseat in Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cGBjQyT9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perhaps no chair is more synonymous with organic design than the Wing chair. First intended as an outstretched reception chair, the piece is expansive like the wings of its namesake. While organic living promotes the harmonious balance between human habitation and the natural world, achieving proper balance is a challenge. It is often left to the designers, those creative leaders of the generation, to guide the way. While the padded fiberglass shell is upholstered in a layer of fabric, the admiration for this piece comes from a much deeper source. First developed in the mid-20th century, the Wing chair is a testament to the potential inherent in human endeavor. While the chair rests firmly on a sturdy polished aluminum frame, it’s the abandonment from the particulars of engineering and industry that make it so endearing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cGBjQyT9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modway","source_asin":"B003X3NV02","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003X3NV02","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003X3NV02","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840992,"name":"Aucma Air Fryer, 5.8QT Hot Air Fryers Oven, XL Electric Air Fryers Oven Cooker with 9 Cooking Preset, Digital Touch Screen Preheat & Nonstick Basket (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LiRQEAl5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"♨HEALTY COOK AND LESS OIL - Aucma Air Fryer cooks by using innovatived dynamic airflow technology to produce 360°circulating hot air around the food. You can enjoy your favorite fried foods the same delicous as deep frying but with 85% less oil. ♨EXTRA LARGE CAPACITY AND VESATILITY - 5.8QT Large air fryers enough to cook meals for the whole family. With 60 minites timer and tempreture range of 104-400℉, you could grill, bake, roast and fry your favariate food easier and faster. Vesatility use for your various need. ♨DIGITAL TOUCH-SCREEN AND 9 COOKING PRESETS - Easy to read digital touch screen with 9 presets menu for convenient cooking. you also can set own time and temperature per your need.A built-in pre-heat function ensures the unit heats to the desired temperature before you begin to cook. ♨AUTO SHUT OFF AND MORE PROTECTION - This hot air fryer will auto shut off and ready signal when cooking complete. Safety power cut off when the outer pot is detached and safety over heating for more protections. ♨DISHWASHER SAFE AND SATISFIED WARRANTY - Non stick outer pot and basket with teflon coating are detachable and diswashable,which is super easy for cleaning. Aucma Air fryer is committed to one-year 100% satisfaction guarantee for replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LiRQEAl5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aucma","source_asin":"B08CB2B3VJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CB2B3VJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CB2B3VJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":840993,"name":"ArtWall Almond Blossom by Vincent Van Gogh Rolled Canvas Art, 24 by 32-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8194F0NMcpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Art Wall's \"Almond Blossom\" by Vincent van Gogh 24x32 Rolled Canvas Art. Image 24x32 with 2-inch White Accent Border. In early 1890, Vincent's brother Theo had a son. He reluctantly accepted the honor of having the new child named Vincent, after himself and became the child's godfather. Immediately after finding about the healthy birth he began on a painting for the baby Blossoming Almond Tree. He wanted it to be hung above the bed in the parents' and child's room. Indeed, speaking of the child his brother's wife wrote \"He always looks with very great interest at Uncle Vincent's paintings\". Almond branches are a subject that Van Gogh visited a few times before. In earlier studies, he painted cut branches set in a vase as a still life. In this picture, Blossoming Almond Tree, for his nephew, he paints a very different composition. Instead of visiting the still life again, he shows white almond tree branches against a blue sky. It is not shown whether these branches are cut from the tree and sitting in a vase outside of the view of the viewer or if they are still on the tree, seen from below looking up towards the sky. It is an unusual composition for both art as a whole and for Van Gogh himself. Like many of Van Gogh's paintings, Blossoming Almond Tree has an influence from Japanese prints. Van Gogh collected and admired Japanese artists and used ideas such as bold color, dark outlines and the beauty of nature in his work. Like pictures by the Japanese artist Hiroshige, Almond Tree shows the branches of a tree against the backdrop of a sky. This Japanese creates a dynamic and modern composition while still being a recognizably Van Gogh painting. Van Gogh's Blossoming Almond Tree, also referred to as Almond Tree, represents much of what Vincent often thought about: rebirth. Trees blooming and flowering announces the beginning of spring and new life. As a gift to celebrate the birth of a child, this could not be more perfect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8194F0NMcpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B009VGU7C0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-840993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009VGU7C0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009VGU7C0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
